# DAX 指标说明

所有指标建在 `fact_sales` 表上。

| 指标                          | DAX                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                     | 业务含义                  |
| --------------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- | --------------------- |
| Gross Revenue               | `CALCULATE(SUM(fact_sales[line_revenue]), fact_sales[is_product_sale]=1)`                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                               | 毛商品销售额，不含邮费/手续费/折扣/退货 |
| Return Amount               | `CALCULATE(-SUM(fact_sales[line_revenue]), fact_sales[is_cancellation]=1, fact_sales[is_product]=1)`                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                    | 商品退货金额，正数展示           |
| Net Revenue                 | `[Gross Revenue] - [Return Amount]`                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                     | 净商品销售额                |
| Orders                      | `CALCULATE(DISTINCTCOUNT(fact_sales[invoice_no]), fact_sales[is_product_sale]=1)`                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                       | 有效商品销售订单数             |
| Customers                   | `CALCULATE(DISTINCTCOUNT(fact_sales[customer_key]), fact_sales[is_customer_sale]=1, fact_sales[customer_key]<>0)`                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                       | 可识别客户数                |
| AOV                         | `DIVIDE([Gross Revenue],[Orders])`                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                      | 平均客单价                 |
| Return Rate                 | `DIVIDE([Return Amount],[Gross Revenue])`                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                               | 退货率                   |
| Repeat Purchase Rate        | Repeat Purchase Rate =<br>VAR CustomerOrders =<br>    SUMMARIZE (<br>        FILTER ( fact_sales, fact_sales[is_customer_sale] = 1 ),<br>        fact_sales[customer_key],<br>        "OrderCount", DISTINCTCOUNT ( fact_sales[invoice_no] )<br>    )<br>RETURN<br>    DIVIDE (<br>        COUNTROWS ( FILTER ( CustomerOrders, [OrderCount] >= 2 ) ),<br>        COUNTROWS ( CustomerOrders )<br>    ) | 订单数≥2的客户/有购买客户        |
| International Revenue Share | `DIVIDE(CALCULATE([Gross Revenue], fact_sales[country]<>"United Kingdom"),[Gross Revenue])`                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                             | 国际收入占比                |
| Median Order Value          | MEDIANX (<br>    SUMMARIZE (<br>        FILTER ( fact_sales, fact_sales[is_product_sale] = 1 ),<br>        fact_sales[invoice_no],<br>        "OrderValue", SUM ( fact_sales[line_revenue] )<br>    ),<br>    [OrderValue]<br>)<br>```                                                                                                                                                                  | 客单价中位数                |
| Top20 Product Revenue Share | Top20 Product Revenue Share =<br>VAR ProductRevenue =<br>    ADDCOLUMNS ( VALUES ( dim_product[stock_code] ), "@Revenue", [Net Revenue] )<br>VAR Top20 =<br>    TOPN ( 20, ProductRevenue, [@Revenue], DESC )<br>RETURN<br>    DIVIDE ( SUMX ( Top20, [@Revenue] ), [Net Revenue] )                                                                                                                     | Top20商品净销售额占比         |
| Full Return Products        | COUNTROWS (<br>    FILTER (<br>        dim_product,<br>        dim_product[gross_revenue] > 0 &&<br>        dim_product[net_revenue] <= 0<br>    )<br>)                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                 | 净销售额≤0的商品数            |
| Revenue per Customer        | `DIVIDE([Gross Revenue],[Customers])`                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                   | 每客户收入                 |
| Total Units                 | `CALCULATE(SUM(fact_sales[quantity]), fact_sales[is_product_sale]=1)`                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                   | 商品销售件数                |
| Avg Basket Units            | `DIVIDE([Total Units],[Orders])`                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                        | 平均每单件数                |
| Revenue MoM %               | VAR CurrentRevenue = [Gross Revenue]<br>VAR PreviousRevenue =<br>    CALCULATE (<br>        [Gross Revenue],<br>        DATEADD ( dim_date[full_date], -1, MONTH )<br>    )<br>RETURN<br>    DIVIDE ( CurrentRevenue - PreviousRevenue, PreviousRevenue )                                                                                                                                               | 月度环比                  |
| New Customers               | CALCULATE (<br>    DISTINCTCOUNT ( dim_customer[customer_key] ),<br>    USERELATIONSHIP ( dim_customer[first_order_date], dim_date[full_date] ),<br>    dim_customer[has_purchases] = 1<br>)                                                                                                                                                                                                            | 首购月新客数                |

## 口径提醒

- `is_valid_sale`：有效正向销售行，可能包含非商品；
- `is_product_sale`：商品销售行，销售/商品/订单指标用这个；
- `is_customer_sale`：可归属客户的商品销售行，客户指标用这个；
- `is_cancellation`：退货/取消发票；
- `is_duplicate`：重复行，不进入任何销售额指标。
